00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:30,000
This School Rocks!

2
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:54,000
School of Life is a comedy, drama, family film directed by William Dear.

3
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:18,000
At Fallbrook Middle School, the annual
student-elected Teacher of the Year award is held.

4
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:42,000
And every year for the last 43 years Norman Warner or most fondly
called Stormin' Norman Warner has won the award.

5
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:06,000
Now that he has died, the burden of carrying the legacy falls into the hands of Matt Warner, the
son of the late Norman Warner who has always lived in the shadow of his father.

6
00:44:24,000 --> 00:44:30,000
Matt Warner, played by David Paymer.

7
00:51:48,000 --> 00:51:54,000
Mr. D, played by Ryan Reynolds.

8
00:59:12,000 --> 00:59:18,000
Elli Warner, played by Kate Vernon.

9
01:06:36,000 --> 01:06:42,000
Dylan Warner, played by Andrew Robb.

10
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:06,000
Norman Warner, played by John Astin.

11
01:21:24,000 --> 01:21:30,000
Principal Bass, played by Don MacKay.

12
01:28:48,000 --> 01:28:54,000
School of Life is a 2005 made-for-television comedy-drama film starring Ryan Reynolds
about a teacher who moves to a town and shakes the old school ways up a bit.

13
01:36:12,000 --> 01:36:18,000
The film premiered on ABC Family on February 19, 2005.

14
01:43:36,000 --> 01:43:42,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
